        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co gitumye Uhoraho, Imana y’Abisirayeli, avuga, ngo N’ukuri yari yaravuze yukw ab’ inzu yawe n’ab’ inzu ya sogokuruza bazokwama bamugendako bar’ imbere yiwe ibihe vyose; ariko noneh’ Uhoraho agize ngo Biragahera; ngo Kukw abamwubaha ari bo azokwubaha, arikw abamukēngēra bazokēngērwa. ",
          "type": "text",
