        {
          "text": "Ngw Ehe rāba, imisi igiye kuza, akūreh’ inkomezi zawe, n’iz’ ab’ inzu ya sogokuruza, hoye kugira uwo mu nzu yawe azoba agishika mu zabukuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
