              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 78:59-64",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngo Maze mu magorwa yawe uzotimamukira ivyiza azoba ahaye abandi Bisirayeli; ngo Kandi nta n’umwe wo mu nzu yawe azoba agishika mu zabukuru kugeza ibihe vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngo Kandi ni hagira umuntu wo kuri wewe azosigara atamukūye ku gicaniro ciwe, na ho nyene bizoba ar’ ugusigara akobotse amaso, atuntuye mu mutima; ngo Kand’ ab’ uruvyaro rw’inzu yawe bose bazogenda bapfa bakenyutse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
