        },
        {
          "text": "Maze ngw Azokwihagurukiriza umuherezi w’umwizigirwa, umuntu azokora nk’ivyari mu mutima wiwe no mu vyiyumviro vyiwe; ngo Kand’ azomwubakira inzu izokwamaho; na we azogendanira uwo yimikishije amavuta ibihe vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
