              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngo Kand’ uko bizogenda n’uku: ng’ Umuntu wese w’agasigarira ko mu nzu yawe azoza amwikubite imbere, amusabe agafeza n’agatsima, amubgire, ati Ndakwinginze, umpe agakorwa kamwe ko mu vy’ubuherezi, kugira ngo mbone utwo kuntunga.",
          "type": "text",
